Recommends: querencia-shell
Provides: x-terminal-emulator
Description: Querencia Desktop terminal (alpha)
 Querencia Terminal is the terminal emulator of Querencia Desktop, a
 classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2, built on GTK 4 and VTE.
 .
 Copy and paste work as in GNOME Terminal 2.x (Ctrl+Shift+C/V,
 Shift+Insert, context menu). Tabs and profiles are not implemented yet.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
